			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "01649971-2a54-453a-9a7b-7948c53ff0bb")
	)
	(text "USB-001: R6 USBHS current-reference resistor\nRenesas QDG Table 2, p.7: 2.2 kohm +/-1%.\nRmin = 2200*(1-0.01) = 2178 ohm\nRmax = 2200*(1+0.01) = 2222 ohm\nInitial tolerance only; not a derived PHY current.\nFull basis + Python check: design/usb_interface.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/usb_interface.md#usb-001-r6-reference-resistor")
		)
		(uuid "125bcc62-4110-41c9-8533-c2109d511e34")
	)
	(text "USB-004: USB-HS analog supply / FB1 + C43\nFB1: 120 ohm at 100 MHz; DCR 0.05 ohm initial max.\nScreen with combined USB-HS current: I = 55.3 mA.\nVdrop = I*R = 2.765 mV; P = I^2*R = 0.153 mW.\nAfter-test DCR 0.10 ohm: 5.53 mV / 0.306 mW.\nC43: 10 uF +/-10%, 35 V X7R; initial 9..11 uF.\nTDK nominal bias curve: 9.644 uF at 3.3 V.\nNot transient or all-corners qualification; verify rail ramp.\nFull calculations: ../design/usb_interface.md [USB-004]"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 75.946 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/usb_interface.md#usb-004-high-speed-analog-supply-filter")
		)
		(uuid "7d31ce58-df5c-4fd8-b179-f80006dcff7f")
	)
	(text "RADIO-008: SPIA_C P700..P703; IRQ26=P704, IRQ19=P705.\nP706=RESET_REQ_N; P707=PWR_EN. Host-domain signals.\nSwitched-domain isolation and reset arbitration remain open.\nPin map + conflicts: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-008-ra8p1-host-allocation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 42.926 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-008-ra8p1-host-allocation")
		)
		(uuid "7f54c0be-47cc-4034-9ea8-027c927e09eb")
	)
	(text "USB-002: USB full-speed supply / U1.U17, C40.\nRenesas QDG Table 1, p.6: 3.3 V with 100 nF bypass.\nC40 = 100*(1 +/-0.10) = 90..110 nF initial; 50 V X7R.\nNominal DC-bias estimate: 99.45 nF at 3.3 V (PWR-001).\nPlace C40 close to VCC_USB with a short VSS_USB return.\nFull basis + Python check: design/usb_interface.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 225.806 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/usb_interface.md#usb-002-full-speed-supply-bypass")
		)
		(uuid "9690f5b6-4378-44a3-b40f-4bbf9ef76ab7")
	)
	(text "PWR-001: C39 AVCC_MIPI bypass, 100 nF (QDG Table 2, p.7).\nTDK C1608X7R1H104K080AA; also used at C6 and C16-C34.\nInitial C = 100*(1 +/-0.10) = 90..110 nF; 50 V X7R.\nTDK DC-bias samples: 99.5575 nF / 3.15 V; 98.9525 nF / 4 V.\nC(3.3 V) = 99.5575 + (3.3-3.15)/0.85*(-0.605) = 99.45 nF.\nInterpolated nominal reference, NOT a guaranteed minimum.\nFinal rail / PDN qualification open; 3.3/50*100 = 6.6% rating.\nFull basis + Python check: design/power_decoupling.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 261.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/power_decoupling.md#pwr-001-c39-mipi-analog-supply-bypass")
		)
		(uuid "ad841f15-915f-4a17-bb70-fe384e5696cf")
	)
	(text "MIPI unused: AVCC_MIPI to VCC; VSS_MIPI to GND.\nLeave VCC18_MIPI and all six D-PHY lanes open.\nFirmware: MSTPCRC.MSTPC10=1 and MSTPC17=1.\nRA8P1 HUM Rev.1.30, section 21.4, p.862."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 66.04 235.966 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "c7265f71-c8c8-43f9-998f-1d6b33f530d1")
	)
	(text "USB-003: USB-HS supply / U1.H15, C41, C42\nRenesas QDG Table 1 p.6: 10 nF ceramic + 47 uF electrolytic.\nC41 = 10*(1+/-0.10) = 9..11 nF initial; 50 V X7R.\nTDK nominal bias model: C41(3.3 V) = 10.084 nF (not guaranteed).\nC42 = 47*(1+/-0.20) = 37.6..56.4 uF initial; 6.3 V.\nVoltage screening: 3.6/6.3*100 = 57.14% rating, not rail sign-off.\nC42 positive to 3V3, negative to GND; no reverse voltage.\nC41 close to H15; short returns to VSS1/VSS2_USBHS.\nFull math + Python / qualification: ../design/usb_interface.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/usb_interface.md#usb-003-high-speed-digital-supply-bypass-and-bulk-capacitance")
		)
		(uuid "e1944758-a8ef-4e3a-9f4a-c5179715e4dd")
	)
